<codeline lineno="6"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="7"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>ZPrimeSelection_intro<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="8"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>`ZPrime`<sp/>class,<sp/>implemented<sp/>in<sp/>Cython,<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>specialized<sp/>selection<sp/>template<sp/>within<sp/>the<sp/>AnalysisG<sp/>framework,<sp/>designed<sp/>for<sp/>comprehensive<sp/>analysis<sp/>of<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson<sp/>related<sp/>selections<sp/>in<sp/>Monte<sp/>Carlo<sp/>16<sp/>(MC16)<sp/>events.<sp/>It<sp/>inherits<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>generic<sp/>`SelectionTemplate`<sp/>class,<sp/>extending<sp/>its<sp/>functionalities<sp/>to<sp/>extract<sp/>and<sp/>organize<sp/>detailed<sp/>information<sp/>about<sp/>truth-level<sp/>top<sp/>quarks,<sp/>children<sp/>particles,<sp/>truth-jets,<sp/>and<sp/>reconstructed<sp/>jets<sp/>associated<sp/>with<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson<sp/>decays.<sp/>This<sp/>class<sp/>facilitates<sp/>a<sp/>high-performance<sp/>extraction<sp/>and<sp/>structuring<sp/>of<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson<sp/>related<sp/>data<sp/>for<sp/>further<sp/>physics<sp/>analysis.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="9"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="10"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>ZPrimeSelection_helper_functions<sp/>Helper<sp/>Functions<sp/>(Python-style,<sp/>Cython-optimized)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="11"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>These<sp/>functions<sp/>are<sp/>designed<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>used<sp/>as<sp/>callbacks<sp/>for<sp/>`self.root_leaves`<sp/>in<sp/>`SelectionTemplate`,<sp/>processing<sp/>data<sp/>as<sp/>it&apos;s<sp/>read<sp/>from<sp/>ROOT<sp/>files.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="12"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="13"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`def<sp/>fx(zp,<sp/>data)`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="14"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>A<sp/>generic<sp/>function<sp/>to<sp/>append<sp/>data<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>list<sp/>attribute<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>`ZPrime`<sp/>instance.<sp/>It<sp/>takes<sp/>an<sp/>attribute<sp/>name<sp/>and<sp/>a<sp/>list<sp/>of<sp/>values.<sp/>If<sp/>the<sp/>attribute<sp/>already<sp/>exists<sp/>and<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>list,<sp/>it<sp/>appends<sp/>the<sp/>new<sp/>values;<sp/>otherwise,<sp/>it<sp/>initializes<sp/>it<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>new<sp/>list.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="15"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>@param<sp/>zp<sp/>An<sp/>instance<sp/>of<sp/>`ZPrime`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="16"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>@param<sp/>data<sp/>A<sp/>tuple<sp/>`(attribute_name_string,<sp/>list_of_values)`<sp/>where<sp/>`attribute_name_string`<sp/>is<sp/>the<sp/>name<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>attribute<sp/>to<sp/>update<sp/>and<sp/>`list_of_values`<sp/>are<sp/>the<sp/>values<sp/>to<sp/>append.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="17"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="18"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>ZPrimeSelection_class<sp/>The<sp/>ZPrime<sp/>Class</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="19"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>`ZPrime`<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>`cdef<sp/>class`<sp/>that<sp/>inherits<sp/>from<sp/>`SelectionTemplate`.<sp/>It<sp/>is<sp/>tailored<sp/>for<sp/>collecting<sp/>and<sp/>organizing<sp/>information<sp/>related<sp/>to<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson<sp/>analysis.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="20"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="21"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@subsection<sp/>ZPrimeSelection_cinit_dealloc<sp/>Constructors<sp/>and<sp/>Destructors</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="22"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`__cinit__(self)`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="23"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>The<sp/>Cython<sp/>&quot;constructor&quot;<sp/>equivalent.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="24"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Initializes<sp/>`self.root_leaves`<sp/>to<sp/>define<sp/>specific<sp/>ROOT<sp/>branches<sp/>(`zprime_truth_tops`,<sp/>`zprime_children`,<sp/>`zprime_truthjets`,<sp/>`zprime_jets`)<sp/>and<sp/>associates<sp/>them<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>`fx`<sp/>helper<sp/>function<sp/>for<sp/>data<sp/>processing<sp/>during<sp/>`InterpretROOT`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="25"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Initializes<sp/>a<sp/>new<sp/>C++<sp/>`zprime`<sp/>object<sp/>and<sp/>assigns<sp/>its<sp/>pointer<sp/>to<sp/>`self.ptr`.<sp/>It<sp/>then<sp/>upcasts<sp/>`self.ptr`<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>`zprime*`<sp/>and<sp/>assigns<sp/>it<sp/>to<sp/>`self.tt`<sp/>for<sp/>specialized<sp/>access.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="26"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
