<codeline lineno="36"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`self.zprime_truth_tops`:<sp/>Populated<sp/>from<sp/>`self.tt.zprime_truth_tops`.</highlight></codeline>
