<codeline lineno="42"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>following<sp/>properties<sp/>are<sp/>implicitly<sp/>defined<sp/>and<sp/>populated<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>`transform_dict_keys`<sp/>method,<sp/>providing<sp/>access<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>processed<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson<sp/>related<sp/>information:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="43"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`@property<sp/>zprime_truth_tops<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>list`:<sp/>List<sp/>of<sp/>truth-level<sp/>top<sp/>quarks<sp/>associated<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="44"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`@property<sp/>zprime_children<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>list`:<sp/>List<sp/>of<sp/>children<sp/>particles<sp/>associated<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>Z&apos;<sp/>boson.</highlight></codeline>
